WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.443
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emma. Welcome to Online Grammar, level B one.

2
00:00:05.743 --> 00:00:08.897
Hi! I'm Visal. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.197 --> 00:00:15.704
Unit thirty-seven: Comparatives: the more… the more. Today you will show that two things change together.

4
00:00:16.004 --> 00:00:18.540
Here is our lesson map. Let's start!

5
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.779
Part one: words. You will learn eight new words.

6
